    "updated_at": "2023-03-30T10:49:29Z",
    "body": "Hi @bhavya-error404 - yes. In this case, you might want to add the regexes based on keys rather than values. They can cookie names for products or infrastructures - \r\n\r\nFor example, \r\n- `_ga` `_gid` is for Google Analytics\r\n- `intercom.*` is for Intercom\r\n\r\nexamples for infra based are -\r\n- `.*srf.*` is for CSRF token\r\n- `JSESSIONID` is for Jetty session\r\n- `AWS.*` for AWS Loadbalancer cookies\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
