    "body": "Hi @harshalkh \r\n\r\nYour analysis is correct, but we should be cautious about over-tagging, especially with common cookies like csrf, as it could lead to false positives. To minimize this, please refine the list, focusing on unique cookies specific to Facebook, like _fbp and _fbc. I've assigned the issue to you in the meantime.",
